  "notes": "Label = ATmega4809 port name (Pxn) where printed; SDA/SCL ports printed as \"PA2/PF2\", \"PA3/PF3\" on images 2-3 (image 1 prints PA2, PA3). Exact duplicate cells (e.g. SCK twice, AIN[n] twice, CIPO/COPI) listed once. Image 4: pads 2-4 also print SAMD11 names (SWDIO, SWCLK, PA14/PA15) and pad 6 prints PF06 and SAMD11 PA28; SAMD11 internal pin callouts, USB N/USB P lines and TX/RX LEDs not transcribed as connectors."
